# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=

# Groq (free plan, no card) — first AI fallback after Gemini.
# Sign up at https://console.groq.com, create a key under API Keys, and
# paste it here. Free plan: openai/gpt-oss-120b + gpt-oss-20b at
# 1,000 requests/day each, plus qwen/qwen3.8-27b for vision. Without it,
# Groq is skipped silently and the app falls back to OpenRouter / Gemini.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# OpenRouter (free :free models, no card) — second AI fallback.
# Sign up at https://openrouter.ai/keys and create a key. Free tier:
# 20 requests/min, 50 requests/day on :free models via the openrouter/free
# router. Without it, OpenRouter is skipped silently. Never commit a real key.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Cerebras (free, no card) — https://cloud.cerebras.ai, create a key under
# API Keys. Free tier: 1M tokens/day, 30 requests/min. Free-tier context is
# capped at 8,192 tokens, so it is used mainly for short jobs. Without it,
# Cerebras is skipped silently.
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=

# NVIDIA NIM (free, no card) — https://build.nvidia.com, sign in with an
# NVIDIA Developer Program account and create a key (starts nvapi-).
# Free tier: 40 requests/min, 10,000 requests/day. NOTE: sign-up sometimes
# asks for phone verification — if it does, skip this provider. Without a
# key, NVIDIA is skipped silently.
NVIDIA_API_KEY=

# SambaNova (free, no card) — https://cloud.sambanova.ai, create a key.
# Free tier: 20 requests/min, 20 requests/day per model, 200K tokens/day
# per model. Without it, SambaNova is skipped silently.
SAMBANOVA_API_KEY=

# Cohere (trial key free, no card) — https://dashboard.cohere.com/api-keys,
# create a trial key. Free tier: 1,000 API calls/month, 20 chat requests/min.
# Trial keys are evaluation-only. Without it, Cohere is skipped silently.
COHERE_API_KEY=

# Cloudflare Workers AI (free, no card) — https://dash.cloudflare.com,
# create an API token (My Profile → API Tokens) and find your Account ID
# on the dashboard home / in the URL. Free tier: 10,000 Neurons/day,
# 300 requests/min. BOTH vars are needed; without either, Cloudflare is
# skipped silently.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# DeepSeek (5M free tokens on signup, no card, VALID 30 DAYS) —
# https://platform.deepseek.com, create a key under API Keys. NOT an
# ongoing free tier: after 30 days / 5M tokens it is pay-as-you-go, so it
# sits near the end of every fallback chain. Without it, DeepSeek is
# skipped silently.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Novita AI ($1 one-time signup credit, no card) — https://novita.ai,
# create a key. Tiny and one-time: once the $1 is spent it is paid-only,
# so it sits LAST in every fallback chain. Without it, Novita is skipped
# silently.
NOVITA_API_KEY=

# SiliconFlow (free credits on signup, no card) — https://cloud.siliconflow.cn,
# create a key under API Keys. OpenAI-compatible. Models: Qwen/Qwen3-8B
# (fast/cheap), deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2, Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-72B-Instruct
# (vision). Without it, SiliconFlow is skipped silently.
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=

# AIML API (free credits on signup, no card) — https://aimlapi.com,
# create a key. OpenAI-compatible, many models behind one key.
# Models: meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct (text), gpt-4o-mini (vision).
# Without it, AIML API is skipped silently.
AIMLAPI_API_KEY=

# Hugging Face Inference Providers (free token, no card) —
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens, create a fine-grained token.
# OpenAI-compatible router. Models: meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct,
# Qwen/Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct, meta-llama/Llama-3.2-11B-Vision-Instruct
# (vision). NOTE: the free serverless tier was reported gone in earlier
# research — re-check at signup. Without it, Hugging Face is skipped
# silently.
HF_TOKEN=

# Moonshot AI / Kimi (free credits on signup, no card) —
# https://platform.moonshot.ai, create a key under API Keys.
# OpenAI-compatible. Models: kimi-k2-0711-preview (Kimi K2, 256K context,
# strong reasoning), moonshot-v1-8k (fast/cheap), moonshot-v1-8k-vision.
# Without it, Moonshot is skipped silently.
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=

# Zhipu AI / GLM (free credits on signup, no card) —
# https://open.bigmodel.cn, create a key under API Keys.
# OpenAI-compatible. Models: glm-4.5 (strong), glm-4.5-air (fast/cheap),
# glm-4.5v (vision). Without it, Zhipu is skipped silently.
ZHIPU_API_KEY=

# Qwen / Alibaba DashScope (free credits on signup, no card) —
# https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio (Model Studio console),
# create a key. OpenAI-compatible (international endpoint).
# Models: qwen-plus (strong), qwen3-8b (fast/cheap),
# qwen2.5-vl-72b-instruct (vision). Without it, DashScope is skipped
# silently.
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=

# AI21 Labs / Jamba (free trial credits on signup, no card — time-limited
# grant, 7 days to 3 months depending on the page) — https://studio.ai21.com,
# create a key. OpenAI-compatible. Model: jamba-mini-2 (text only).
# Without it, AI21 is skipped silently.
AI21_API_KEY=

# Upstage / Solar (free signup credit, no card — per 2026-10-22 verification;
# a 2026-11-26 probe says the general signup credit is now UNCONFIRMED and
# solar-pro4 free access until 2027-03-31 is under an institutional-approval
# program — verify at signup) — https://console.upstage.ai, create a key.
# OpenAI-compatible. Model: solar-pro4 (text only). Without it, Upstage is
# skipped silently.
UPSTAGE_API_KEY=

# MiniMax (free trial credits on signup, no card mentioned — ¥15, ~30 days)
# — https://platform.minimaxi.com (international), create a key.
# OpenAI-compatible. Model: MiniMax-M2.7 (text only). NOTE: one source says
# trial credits are tied to phone or email verification — if signup needs
# phone verification, skip this provider. Without it, MiniMax is skipped
# silently.
MINIMAX_API_KEY=

# 01.AI / Yi (¥10 free credits on signup, 5 RPM) — https://platform.lingyiwanwu.com,
# create a key. OpenAI-compatible (base https://api.lingyiwanwu.com/v1).
# Model: yi-lightning (text only). Signup by email or phone; international
# phone numbers reportedly work. Without it, 01.AI is skipped silently.
LINGYI_API_KEY=

# Sarvam AI (₹100 free credits on signup, never expire, no card) —
# https://dashboard.sarvam.ai, create a key. OpenAI-compatible
# (base https://api.sarvam.ai/v1 — /v1 serves only sarvam-105b and
# sarvam-105b-conversations). Model: sarvam-105b (text only, reasoning on
# by default). Without it, Sarvam is skipped silently.
SARVAM_API_KEY=

# REMOVED 2026-11-26 — Vercel AI Gateway (AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY): its free
# credits require a credit card on file, which this app never adds, and
# its account was suspended for insufficient balance, taking live
# generation down with it (2026-11-25). Do not re-add it.

# Pollinations — NO KEY NEEDED, nothing to paste here. The app always
# tries it last as a safety net: https://text.pollinations.ai, model
# "openai". Verified live 2026-11-25 (free public text API, no signup).
# Its OpenAI-compatible POST endpoint could not be live-tested from this
# environment (approval timeout) — if it ever fails, the chain simply
# ends there, exactly as it would without Pollinations.

# GitHub Models — UNVERIFIED, needs a GitHub token (GITHUB_TOKEN).
# The inference host answered a GET with HTTP 200 on 2026-11-25, but the
# authenticated POST test was blocked by an approval timeout — run ONE
# curl before setting this (see docs/api-hunt-2026-11-25.md):
#   TOKEN="$(gh auth token)"; curl -s -X POST \
#     https://models.github.ai/inference/chat/completions \
#     -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#     -d '{"model":"openai/gpt-4.1-mini","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say BANANA"}],"max_tokens":10}'
# If that returns a completion, paste the token into Vercel as
# GITHUB_TOKEN (never commit it). Until it is verified and set, GitHub
# Models is skipped silently.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Supabase (free tier) — create a project named "studysmart" at
# https://supabase.com/dashboard, apply supabase/migrations/*.sql in the SQL
# editor, then paste the project URL and anon key here (never commit real
# values). Without these, accounts / saved guides / Browse / friends are
# disabled with a clear message, and generation still works.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# YouTube Data API (optional) — a free key from the Google Cloud Console
# (enable the YouTube Data API v3) lets /api/videos search YouTube directly.
# Without it, the app asks Gemini for candidate video IDs and verifies every
# one with YouTube's oEmbed endpoint before showing it; if nothing verifies,
# the guide shows YouTube search links instead. Never commit a real key.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
